*** Keywords ***

TC 10513 Feature Activation 8DL8UL
    [Documentation]
    ...     Preconditions:  CB08940 & CB010513 are enabled
    ...     Actions:        Cell setup & call setup with 3 UEs:
    ...                     UE1 registered on NrCell(1)=16386 : 0x4002 DL L1PoolId=10 L1SubPoolId=0 (ZAB eligible)
    ...                     UE2 registered on Nrcell(2)=16390 : 0x4006 DL L1PoolId=10 L1SubPoolId=0 (non ZAB)
    ...                     UE3 registered on NrCell(3)=16388 : 0x4004 DL L1PoolId=10 L1SubPoolId=1 (non ZAB)
    ...                     UE1 nonGBR DL Tput=1,2 Gbps , UE2 nonGBR DL Tput=10mbps, UE3 DL Tput=175mbps
    ...     Checks:         Zab privilege check : Cell 1 zab privileged=1, Cell 2 & 3 zab privileged=0;
    ...                     PM counters check : value as expected
    ...     Verdict:        Zab privilege check & PM counters value check as expected
    [Arguments]            ${param}
    ...                    ${vendor_custom}
    Init Sequence          ${param}
    Step                   Set RAD Params Of 10513-A
    Critical Step          Deploy Vendor File Config  vendor_param=${vendor_custom}  is_perform_full_commissioning=${True}
    Dated Log New Line     ${vendor_custom}
    Step                   Multi Cells Setup 10513                 argument=${param.nbCell}
    Step                   SA Call DL UL Traffic With UE Profile     argument=${Profile_UE_1_ZAB_SP0}
    Step                   SA Call DL UL Traffic With UE Profile     argument=${Profile_UE_2_ZAB_SP0}
    Step                   SA Call DL UL Traffic With UE Profile     argument=${Profile_UE_3_ZAB_SP0}
    Step                   Activate Sherpa On All Cells
    Step                   sleep    1s
    Step                   Stop Sherpa Collection
    Step                   CB010513-ABIP-Keywords.TTI Trace Collection
    Step                   Calling Panda Extract Csv function
    Step                   Verification of BB Pooling Mode within PRB Pooling Allocation Report    pool_id=10
    Step                   Verification of BB Pooling Mode within PRB Pooling Allocation Report    pool_id=13
    Step                   Verification of Pool Id within PRB Pooling Report    pool_id=10    subpool_id=0
    Step                   Verification of Pool Id within PRB Pooling Report    pool_id=10    subpool_id=1
    Step                   Verification of Pool Id within PRB Pooling Report    pool_id=13    subpool_id=2
    Step                   Verification of Pool Id within PRB Pooling Report    pool_id=13    subpool_id=3
    Step                   Verification of BB Pooling cell distribution within PRB Pooling Report    nrCell_id=0x4001    subpool_id=2
    Step                   Verification of BB Pooling cell distribution within PRB Pooling Report    nrCell_id=0x4002    subpool_id=0
    Step                   Verification of BB Pooling cell distribution within PRB Pooling Report    nrCell_id=0x4003    subpool_id=3
    Step                   Verification of BB Pooling cell distribution within PRB Pooling Report    nrCell_id=0x4004    subpool_id=1
    Step                   Verification of BB Pooling cell distribution within PRB Pooling Report    nrCell_id=0x4005    subpool_id=2
    Step                   Verification of BB Pooling cell distribution within PRB Pooling Report    nrCell_id=0x4006    subpool_id=0
    Step                   CB008940-G-Keywords.Check Min and MAX PRB values
    Step                   CB008940-G-Keywords.Verification of Variable Stream PRB Information within PRB Pooling Report
    Step                   CB008940-I-J-Keywords.Verify ZAB Privilege cells on MP
    Step                   CB010513 Verification of DL PRB Allocation
    Step                   sleep    600s
    Step                   CB008940-I-J-Keywords.Collect Lastest PM Counters File
    Dated Log New Line     Checking Pooling counters for DL : M55308C10003 PRBs available for PDSCH  (Legacy)
    Step                   CB010513-ABIP-Keywords.Check CB9142 PM Counters    ${PRB_AVAIL_PDSCH_LEGACY_Expected}
    Dated Log New Line     Checking Pooling counters for DL : M55308C10005 PRBs available for PDSCH with L1 baseband pooling activated
    Step                   CB010513-ABIP-Keywords.Check CB9142 PM Counters    ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected}
    Dated Log New Line     Checking Pooling counters for DL : M55308C10004 PRBs available for PUSCH
    Step                   CB010513-ABIP-Keywords.Check CB9142 PM Counters    ${PRB_AVAIL_PUSCH_LEGACY_Expected}
    Dated Log New Line     Checking Pooling counters for UL : M55308C10006 PRBs available for PUSCH with L1 baseband pooling activated
    Step                   CB010513-ABIP-Keywords.Check CB9142 PM Counters    ${7113_UL_BB_POOL_Counter_Expected}
    Dated Log New Line     Checking Pooling counters for DL : M55308C10001
    Step                   CB010513-ABIP-Keywords.Check CB9142 PM Counters    ${8940_J_DL_Slots_Counter_Expected}

Suite Setup CB010513-ABIP
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     customs configurations scf et basic setup
    ...     Actions:        it performs the generic suite setup and backup the configurations files
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        suite setup is passed
    [Arguments]             ${scfPath}=${EMPTY}
    ...                     ${basiccfgPath}=${EMPTY}
    Setup.Suite Setup From Scratch    keepAllUeDataInCfgFile=${True}        automaticTeardown=${True}
    ...                     scfcPathname=${scfPath}     basicPathname=${basiccfgPath}
    Backup Files
    ${scf_suite_setup_backup}         OAM Get SCF File    file=SCF_Suite_Setup_Backup.xml
    Set Suite Variable      ${scf_suite_setup_backup}
    Dated Log               SCF backup file = ${scf_suite_setup_backup}

Perform Recommissionning
    Oam.OAM Perform Full Commissioning  scf_file=${SCF_SETUP_PATH}
    WA Airscale Wait for Ready    ${GNB_DU}
    # Restart.F1 Wait Link Classical

Set RAD Params Of 10513-A
   [Documentation]     Add or Modify the RAD params of 10513 To Activate CB008941 feature
    ...                will be replaced later by NIDD params
    ...                0x580117=1 #CSI-RS Event Sherpa
    Dated Log New Line   Add RAD params of 10513-A rd-parameter and PDL rules update ......
    ${rad_param_1}=      create dictionary       field=0x580117    value=1
    ${rad_param_list}=       Create List         ${rad_param_1}
    Dated Log New Line    RAD params :  ${rad_param_list}
    SetConfig.Set Fields in swconfig DU       param_list=${rad_param_list}
    Dated Log New Line   RAD params of 10513-A update completed

SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile
    [Arguments]                      ${ue_profile}
    [Documentation]                  1  UE SA call  based on UE profile (ue_id, pdu, gw, dl_tput, ul_tput, deviation)
    ...                              This keyword can be used to perform a UE call based on the UE profile
    ...                              how to use :
    ...                              - create a dictionary of ue profile with the following structure:
    ...                                 &{Profile_UE}
    ...                                     ue_id=1
    ...                                     pdu=1
    ...                                     gw=1
    ...                                     dl_tput=175   #(tput in mbps)
    ...                                     deviation=40  #(percentage of expected deviation of tput)
    ...                              - call the keyword with the UE profile
    ...                                     SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile     ${Profile_UE}
    CallSetup.UE Register            ue=${ue_profile.ue_id}
    sleep                            1s
    CallSetup.Launch PDU Session     ue=${ue_profile.ue_id}     pdu=${ue_profile.pdu}       gw=${ue_profile.gw}
    sleep                            1s
    ${ueSetting}                     set variable            ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    ${ueSetting.pdu}                 set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    ${ueSetting.ue}                  set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    Traffic UE DL                    ueSetting=${BASIC_UE_SA}    throughput=${ue_profile.dl_tput}
    ...                              shouldBeStop=False          deviation=${ue_profile.deviation}
    ...                              shouldBeCheck=False

SA Call DL UL Traffic With UE Profile
    [Arguments]                      ${ue_profile}
    [Documentation]                  1  UE SA call  based on UE profile (ue_id, pdu, gw, dl_tput, ul_tput, deviation)
    ...                              This keyword can be used to perform a UE call based on the UE profile
    ...                              how to use :
    ...                              - create a dictionary of ue profile with the following structure:
    ...                                 &{Profile_UE}
    ...                                     ue_id=1
    ...                                     pdu=1
    ...                                     gw=1
    ...                                     dl_tput=175   #(tput in mbps)
    ...                                     deviation=40  #(percentage of expected deviation of tput)
    ...                              - call the keyword with the UE profile
    ...                                     SA Call DL Traffic With UE Profile     ${Profile_UE}
    CallSetup.UE Register            ue=${ue_profile.ue_id}
    sleep                            1s
    CallSetup.Launch PDU Session     ue=${ue_profile.ue_id}     pdu=${ue_profile.pdu}       gw=${ue_profile.gw}
    sleep                            1s
    ${ueSetting}                     set variable            ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    ${ueSetting.pdu}                 set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    ${ueSetting.ue}                  set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    Traffic UE DL                    ueSetting=${BASIC_UE_SA}    throughput=${ue_profile.dl_tput}
    ...                              shouldBeStop=False          deviation=${ue_profile.deviation}
    ...                              shouldBeCheck=False
    # Traffic UE UL                    ueSetting=${BASIC_UE_SA}    throughput=${ue_profile.ul_tput}
    # ...                              shouldBeStop=False          deviation=${ue_profile.deviation}
    # ...                              shouldBeCheck=False

DL Traffic With UE Profile
    [Arguments]                      ${ue_profile}
    [Documentation]                  1  UE DL Traffic  based on UE profile (ue_id, pdu, gw, dl_tput, ul_tput, deviation)
    ...                              This keyword can be used to perform ONLY DL Traffic based on the UE profile
    ...                              how to use :
    ...                              - create a dictionary of ue profile with the following structure:
    ...                                 &{Profile_UE}
    ...                                     ue_id=1
    ...                                     pdu=1
    ...                                     gw=1
    ...                                     dl_tput=175   #(tput in mbps)
    ...                                     deviation=40  #(percentage of expected deviation of tput)
    ...                              - call the keyword with the UE profile
    ...                                     DL Traffic With UE Profile     ${Profile_UE}
    ${ueSetting}                     set variable            ${BASIC_UE_SA}
    ${ueSetting.pdu}                 set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    ${ueSetting.ue}                  set variable            ${ue_profile.ue_id}
    Traffic UE DL                    ueSetting=${BASIC_UE_SA}    throughput=${ue_profile.dl_tput}
    ...                              shouldBeStop=False          deviation=${ue_profile.deviation}
    ...                              shouldBeCheck=False

Stop DL Traffic For a given UE
    [Documentation]                 Stop a traffic previously started
    [Arguments]                     ${ue_profile}
    ...                             ${dir}=dl
    ...                             ${maxThroughputPerTransfer}=175
    Dated log                       Stop ${dir} data traffic : UE=${ue_profile.ue_id}
    ${ue_throughput}                Get Variable Value                  ${ue_profile.dl_tput}
    ${trf_throughput}               Set Variable If
    ...                             '${ue_throughput}'!='None'          ${ue_throughput}
    ${nb_trf}                       Get Number Of Transfers
    ...                             throughput=${trf_throughput}
    ...                             maxThroughputPerTransfer=${maxThroughputPerTransfer}
    FOR  ${idx}    IN RANGE     ${nb_trf}
        ${trf_id}                   Evaluate                            ${trf_id_1}+${idx}
        wtsemu.Trf Data Stop        ue=${ue_profile.ue_id}
        ...                         dir=dl                             trf_id=${trf_id}
        ...                         pdu=${ue_profile.pdu}
    END

Multi Cells Setup 10513
    [Arguments]       ${nbCell}
    ${msgStr}=    Catenate  Test ${nbCell} Cells Setup
    Dated Log   ${msgStr}
    Setup Wtsemu SA
    sleep    60s
    WTS Set X2 Link
    sleep    5s
