    ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_1}=    Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                            ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_1_idx}
    ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_2}=    Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                            ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_2_idx}
    ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_3}=    Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                            ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_3_idx}
    ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_4}=    Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                            ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_4_idx}
    ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_5}=    Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                            ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_5_idx}
    ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_6}=    Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                            ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_6_idx}
    Dated Log    +---------+--------------+---------------+
    Dated Log    |NrCellId | ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.PM_ID} value: Expected Value :
    Dated Log    +---------+--------------+---------------+
    Dated Log    | ${NRCELLID_1_idx} | ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_1} | ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_1_Expected}
    Dated Log    | ${NRCELLID_2_idx} | ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_2} | ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_2_Expected}
    Dated Log    | ${NRCELLID_3_idx} | ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_3} | ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_3_Expected}
    Dated Log    | ${NRCELLID_4_idx} | ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_4} | ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_4_Expected}
    Dated Log    | ${NRCELLID_5_idx} | ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_5} | ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_5_Expected}
    Dated Log    | ${NRCELLID_6_idx} | ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_6} | ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_6_Expected}
    Dated Log    +---------+--------------+---------------+
    should be true      ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_1} == ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_1_Expected}
    should be true      ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_2} == ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_2_Expected}
    should be true      ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_3} == ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_3_Expected}
    should be true      ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_4} == ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_4_Expected}
    should be true      ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_5} == ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_5_Expected}
    should be true      ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_6} == ${BB_POOL_Counter_Expected.CELL_6_Expected}

CB010513 Verification of DL PRB Allocation
    [Documentation]
    [Arguments]
